        <body>
            <div xml:id="d477">

                <pb facs="0636" n="530" sameAs="frus:frus1906p1/pg530"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Minister O’Brien to
                        the Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Copenhagen</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1906-02-09"><hi rendition="#italic">February 9,
                        1906</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 74.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Referring to dispatch No. 47 from Mr.
                    Lorillard, Chargé d’affaires of this legation of November 27, in which reference
                    was made to an unratified treaty between Denmark and the Netherlands, I now have
                    information that on the 6th instant the Landsthing took affirmative action, and
                    it may be assumed, therefore, that an early exchange will follow.</p>
                <p>Along with the dispatch in question, you were provided with a copy of the treaty
                    referred to.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">T. J. O’Brien.</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d477-a1.xml" xpointer="d477-a1"/>
